{'symbol': 'TMO', 'date': '2021-07-08 17:00:00', 'title': 'THERMO FISHER SCIENTIFIC DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'WALTHAM, MASS., JULY 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THERMO FISHER SCIENTIFIC INC. (NYSE: TMO), THE WORLD LEADER IN SERVING SCIENCE, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS AUTHORIZED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.26 PER COMMON SHARE, PAYABLE ON OCTOBER 15, 2021, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF SEPTEMBER 15, 2021.'}